## Seed press

seed-press-cannot-insert = You can't put { CAPITALIZE(THE($name)) } in there.
seed-press-full = { CAPITALIZE(THE($name)) } is full!
seed-press-empty = There's nothing inside { THE($name) }.
seed-press-busy = { CAPITALIZE(THE($name)) } is already processing!
seed-press-start = You start extracting seeds...
seed-press-extracted = You extract {$count} packets of seeds.
seed-press-seedless = {$count} of them have no seeds!
seed-press-examine = It holds {$count} items.
seed-press-eject = Empty contents
seed-press-ejected = You empty the contents of { THE($name) }.
